{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/b40dc94dc6b4947dd0596214794b0542.poster.avif?t=1761215371\" width=602 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/b40dc94dc6b4947dd0596214794b0542.webm?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/b40dc94dc6b4947dd0596214794b0542.mp4?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/8939749a4b84ff07dbe9b31cb9582b5f.poster.avif?t=1761215371\" width=800 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/8939749a4b84ff07dbe9b31cb9582b5f.webm?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/8939749a4b84ff07dbe9b31cb9582b5f.mp4?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Spells, Loot and Action</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/96a7c5feaede8ce4b4682b441b87108b.poster.avif?t=1761215371\" width=1004 height=686 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/96a7c5feaede8ce4b4682b441b87108b.webm?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last guardian and the last hope of your people as the shadows of darkness spread across the land. Strengthen your hero with character traits, abilities, and powerful relics. Each playthrough offers new builds, new choices, and new destinies. Use acquired spells and loot, manage your mana and stamina, and defeat hordes of enemies with unique mechanics and tactics!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Inventory Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/769d6a46b18c6c2f245780719d27d55f.poster.avif?t=1761215371\" width=860 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/769d6a46b18c6c2f245780719d27d55f.webm?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your true power lies in your backpack. Every item you carry can alter your destiny. Strategically position and rotate items of varying sizes to maximize limited space. Items interact with their neighbors, creating unique synergies, amplifying stats, or unlocking hidden effects. Some spells must be inserted into weapons or armor to be unleashed, while others are strengthened by adjacent items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose Your Adventure</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/9d1d61e308bd4e853c477054ba8418bf.poster.avif?t=1761215371\" width=1000 height=554 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/9d1d61e308bd4e853c477054ba8418bf.webm?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the procedurally generated map, picking your route upward. Battle enemies and elites while finding chests, campfires, merchants, and more. Choose carefully and adapt your strategy to survive through three deadly Acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different - new loot, new talents, new challenges. How far can you ascend?  <br>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/9d4fbec605ce589745f1a8249a93ea8b.webp?t=1761215371\" width=800 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backpack Synergies</strong>\u00a0- Items influence neighboring gear. Position and rotate your loot to unlock hidden bonuses and game-changing multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spells &amp; Attunements</strong>\u00a0- Socket powerful spells into weapons, armor, or jewellery to unleash unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Talent Trees</strong>\u00a0- Every run generates a character progression path. No two builds are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Loot Variety</strong>\u00a0- Discover procedurally generated items with affixes, blessings, curses, attunements, and crafting upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Playstyles</strong>\u00a0- Fight with bows, swords, staffs and many more weapons to come! Each weapons suggests different playstyle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Rare Finds</strong>\u00a0- Merge crafting materials, discover runes, and seek out hidden merchants to forge unique equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> - Manage mana and stamina while dodging, blocking, and striking in fast-paced encounters against enemies with unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Adventures</strong>\u00a0- Explore three Acts of branching paths with enemies, elites, campfires, treasures, and secret encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay Without End</strong>\u00a0- With randomized loot, talent trees, and maps, every run tells a different story.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3446060?t=1761215371","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3446060?t=1761215371","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/a4974624b2c97e485617216bcac442f2da57ea82/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761215371","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/a4974624b2c97e485617216bcac442f2da57ea82/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1761215371","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/b40dc94dc6b4947dd0596214794b0542.poster.avif?t=1761215371\" width=602 height=54 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/b40dc94dc6b4947dd0596214794b0542.webm?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/b40dc94dc6b4947dd0596214794b0542.mp4?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/8939749a4b84ff07dbe9b31cb9582b5f.poster.avif?t=1761215371\" width=800 height=152 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/8939749a4b84ff07dbe9b31cb9582b5f.webm?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/8939749a4b84ff07dbe9b31cb9582b5f.mp4?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Spells, Loot and Action</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/96a7c5feaede8ce4b4682b441b87108b.poster.avif?t=1761215371\" width=1004 height=686 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/96a7c5feaede8ce4b4682b441b87108b.webm?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the last guardian and the last hope of your people as the shadows of darkness spread across the land. Strengthen your hero with character traits, abilities, and powerful relics. Each playthrough offers new builds, new choices, and new destinies. Use acquired spells and loot, manage your mana and stamina, and defeat hordes of enemies with unique mechanics and tactics!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <strong>Inventory Management</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/769d6a46b18c6c2f245780719d27d55f.poster.avif?t=1761215371\" width=860 height=690 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/769d6a46b18c6c2f245780719d27d55f.webm?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >But your true power lies in your backpack. Every item you carry can alter your destiny. Strategically position and rotate items of varying sizes to maximize limited space. Items interact with their neighbors, creating unique synergies, amplifying stats, or unlocking hidden effects. Some spells must be inserted into weapons or armor to be unleashed, while others are strengthened by adjacent items.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>Choose Your Adventure</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/9d1d61e308bd4e853c477054ba8418bf.poster.avif?t=1761215371\" width=1000 height=554 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/9d1d61e308bd4e853c477054ba8418bf.webm?t=1761215371\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Climb the procedurally generated map, picking your route upward. Battle enemies and elites while finding chests, campfires, merchants, and more. Choose carefully and adapt your strategy to survive through three deadly Acts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every run is different - new loot, new talents, new challenges. How far can you ascend?  <br>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/extras/9d4fbec605ce589745f1a8249a93ea8b.webp?t=1761215371\" width=800 height=56 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Backpack Synergies</strong>\u00a0- Items influence neighboring gear. Position and rotate your loot to unlock hidden bonuses and game-changing multipliers.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Spells &amp; Attunements</strong>\u00a0- Socket powerful spells into weapons, armor, or jewellery to unleash unique abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Procedural Talent Trees</strong>\u00a0- Every run generates a character progression path. No two builds are ever the same.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Endless Loot Variety</strong>\u00a0- Discover procedurally generated items with affixes, blessings, curses, attunements, and crafting upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Weapons &amp; Playstyles</strong>\u00a0- Fight with bows, swords, staffs and many more weapons to come! Each weapons suggests different playstyle!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Crafting &amp; Rare Finds</strong>\u00a0- Merge crafting materials, discover runes, and seek out hidden merchants to forge unique equipment.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Dynamic Combat</strong> - Manage mana and stamina while dodging, blocking, and striking in fast-paced encounters against enemies with unique mechanics.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Randomized Adventures</strong>\u00a0- Explore three Acts of branching paths with enemies, elites, campfires, treasures, and secret encounters.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Replay Without End</strong>\u00a0- With randomized loot, talent trees, and maps, every run tells a different story.</p></li></ul>","developers":["ThatFriendlyDev"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3446060/11ab84c0886efffd849ea3385af090be12d502a7/header.jpg?t=1761215371","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":[],"mac_requirements":[],"movies":[{"dash_av1":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3446060/843775/a15af4e89a08f3fd275479f621782ff3775707e9/1750851834/dash_av1.mpd?t=1743061319","dash_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3446060/843775/a15af4e89a08f3fd275479f621782ff3775707e9/1750851834/dash_h264.mpd?t=1743061319","highlight":true,"hls_h264":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3446